    "search": "Boulder 2025 LIVE IMMERSIVE AUDIOVISUAL PERFORMANCE LIVE ELECTRONICS SOUND DESIGN SPATIAL / MULTICHANNEL AUDIO ELECTRONIC C-LAB Sound Festival 《Cutting-Edge Contemporary Music & Sounds》 Taiwan Sound Lab C-LAB, Taipei, Taiwan Created with game engines, Boulder is an audiovisual performance about labor, the artificial and the natural, the organic and the inorganic. Figures wander, push boulders, and hesitate—mirroring humanity in miniature. Combining game engines, computer music, and immersive sound technologies, Boulder seeks to deconstruct and reconstruct related contemporary issues, offering modern individuals a space to rethink their own existence, guiding the audience to drift between technological narratives and body perception. Visual Design XTRUX Sound Design Chun-Wei Tseng, Yung-Jen Huang Electronic Music Performance PO HAO CHEN Photography Aquamarinefilm, Yen-Chi Chen Taiwan Sound Lab Cécile Huang, Chia-Hui Chen, Hungkai Wen, Yung-Hsin Cheng, Jing-Shiuan Tsang, Hsien-Te Hsieh, Yun-Fang Shen Boulder"
